{"id":"d5b4cac238c10c75","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-implicit-definability.md","title":"Implicit Definability","display":"df-implicit-definability — Implicit Definability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-implicit-definability","aliases":["57-df-implicit-definability"],"display":"df-implicit-definability — Implicit Definability","depends_on":["[[57-df-theory]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[57-df-reduct]]","[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-implicit-definability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-implicit-definability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-implicit-definability — Implicit Definability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9c053a73bd2d84c4\" href=\"?note=9c053a73bd2d84c4\" title=\"57-df-theory\">57-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6a64ba5f871237a2\" href=\"?note=6a64ba5f871237a2\" title=\"57-df-reduct\">57-df-reduct</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0\\subseteq S\">\\(S_0\\subseteq S\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6a64ba5f871237a2\" href=\"?note=6a64ba5f871237a2\" title=\"57-df-reduct\">57-df-reduct</a> 的相容子签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\setminus\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S_0)\">\\(P\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\setminus\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S_0)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>。结构及理论满足关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0\">\\(S_0\\)</span> 是固定环境参数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ImplDef}(P,T)\">\\(\\mathrm{ImplDef}(P,T)\\)</span> 是本原子定义的二元谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 的元数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，子签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0\">\\(S_0\\)</span> 使用上述固定环境。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}implicit\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ImplDef}(P,T)\\longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S)\\\n\\Bigl(\\mathfrak A\\models T\\land\\mathfrak B\\models T\\land\n\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright S_0=\\mathfrak B\\upharpoonright S_0\n\\longrightarrow P^{\\mathfrak A}=P^{\\mathfrak B}\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}implicit\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ImplDef}(P,T)\\longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}(S)\\\n\\Bigl(\\mathfrak A\\models T\\land\\mathfrak B\\models T\\land\n\\mathfrak A\\upharpoonright S_0=\\mathfrak B\\upharpoonright S_0\n\\longrightarrow P^{\\mathfrak A}=P^{\\mathfrak B}\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保持原来的同论域、同归约判据；不把“归约同构”误换成“归约相等”。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"9c053a73bd2d84c4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-reduct","status":"resolved","id":"6a64ba5f871237a2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-reduct]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-reduct","status":"resolved","id":"6a64ba5f871237a2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S_0\\subseteq S$ 为 [[57-df-reduct]] 的相容子签名，$n\\ge1$，$P\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\setminus\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S_0)$，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$。结构及理论满足关系见 [[57-df-structure]]、[[57-df-satisfaction]]；$S_0$ 是固定环境参数。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S_0\\subseteq S$ 为 [[57-df-reduct]] 的相容子签名，$n\\ge1$，$P\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\se